{"channelId":"UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","row":["Calhoun Community College",1960,"Calhoun Community College is Alabama's largest 2-year college with more than 12-thousand students.  Calhoun is located in the center of North Alabama serving Huntsville-Decatur-Athens and surrounding communities.  Calhoun Educational Television (CETV) operates from the institutions main campus in Decatur.  Calhoun is about an hour North of Birmingham, an hour South of Nashville, Atlanta is three hours to the East and Memphis is three hours to the West.  Enjoy all of our videos...and stay tuned many more are on the way!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:59.589Z","channelId":"UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"c96117c0a7e7098b8801960ba4ba973395adedc6e48465371490d7376997c075","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"f855e7ec98fa1b5a5c0b268cc7c72999eb0efc683e131f4dddef4498fea48887"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":1960,"raw":"1.96K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCn0I3lrR-O07OoyaReXof7w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:59.589Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"single_sample","role":"undetermined","flags":["当前仅有相关内容或名称线索，尚无匹配的本人专业简介；不列入职业联系优选"],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aohZr5UVA1I"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"media_or_education","excerpt":"hens and surrounding communities. Calhoun Educational Television (CETV) operates from the institutions mai